<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0611_T26R0701_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You! How your homie trainin’ comin’?\rYou ever notice big round boulders in\nthe mountains right in your way?\rMove ’em with Muscle!\rOld Heads at Mt. Mortar got extra,\nor so I heard. They got everythin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0611_T26R0701_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">*gobble*...*gobble*...\r...*CHOKE*!\nAck... I’m chokin’! HELP!\rWhew! That was close.\nI should chew. Nah. I’m good.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0611_T26R0701_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whenever I roll through Olivine, I HIT\nthe Olivine Café.\rEverything on the menu make me feel\nSTRONGER. I’m on my ninth plate.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0611_T26R0701_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Olivine Café menu is BIG plates for\nBIG Dock Workers!\rI’m a accountant. I’m still eatin’ ’em.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0611_T26R0701_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: AYO!\n...!\rThese... these empty plates ain’t\nall mine...\rEr...\rThe person who sat here before me\nate a LOT...\rAnyway, wanna swap numbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0611_T26R0701_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} saved Jasmine’s number\nin the Pokégear!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0611_T26R0701_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: Now we can hit each other up\nanytime.\rI can scrap around noon on\nWednesdays.\fRight after lunch. My SECOND lunch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0611_T26R0701_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: Oh... I understand...\nI’ll just eat my feelings.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0611_T26R0701_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: You change your mind?\nWanna swap numbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0611_T26R0701_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: We seem to...run into each\nother a lot.\rWhy don’t we take a pic\nto remember it? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0611_T26R0701_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: You ready?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0611_T26R0701_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: You did good. We look nice.\nThere’s food in my teeth, ain’t it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0611_T26R0701_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jasmine: I see...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0611_T26R0701_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your Photo Album full.\rGo on your PC and delete\nsome pics.</language>
	</row>
</body>
